arefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are based around <strong>resource mangement</strong>, knowing when to push for extra damage and when to play defensively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Most actions cost <strong>shadow coins,</strong>\u00a0which you get more of at the start of your turn. You can use those coins to <strong>draw more cards</strong>, and to <strong>combine ones already in your hand!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/9c569139fa6a1bde8fc8c9e8003ad2e4.poster.avif?t=1755437613\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/9c569139fa6a1bde8fc8c9e8003ad2e4.webm?t=1755437613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/9c569139fa6a1bde8fc8c9e8003ad2e4.mp4?t=1755437613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151840/extras/81fb0d1d2da9771d364c38e7878484df.avif?t=1755437613\" width=618 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique experience every time you start a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically <strong>infinite </strong>amount of card combinations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Unique card skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Amulets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Explorable rooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cool fights and bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird, unsettling storyline with 